Board modules
-------------
PrismD loads PICASSO2.driver (also the Picasso IV), ZZ9000.driver, Z3660.driver,
P96.driver or UAEGFX.driver
from LIBS:Prism. Install_PrismRTG installs these with PrismD. For a build
run in place, PROGDIR:Drivers is also searched. Use matching PrismD and
modules; incompatible module layouts are rejected before probing hardware.
Each module has a 16 KB stack. Driver diagnostics use PrismD's output,
including redirected logs. Claimed P96/UAE contexts remain until reboot;
PrismD can exit once its display patches and API users are gone.
